  "shortDescription": "Build your own Outdoor Store and Camping Business in the heart of Red Shore Valley! Arrange your shelves, manage your stock, construct facilities on your campsite, and take care of every guest. Grow from humble beginnings into a thriving business surrounded by nature!",
  "zhShortDescription": "经营你的露营地，布置帐篷、管理资源、吸引游客。",
  "description": "• Sell campsite tickets, unlock new camping areas, and build essential facilities like showers and restrooms as you grow your business. Creating an organized, functional, and attractive campsite is up to you. • Fill your shelves with products, handle sales at the register, and create a tidy shopping space where customers can browse comfortably. A well-managed store looks better and helps bring in more sales. • Assign tasks to your workers, organize daily operations, clean messy areas, and repair damaged structures. Keeping your business running smoothly means staying on top of things every day. • Remove trespassers, deal with raccoons, and protect your business from disruptive saboteurs. Sometimes keeping order means stepping in and handling the chaos yourself. • Design your own signs and ",
