      "review": "I went into Campsite Hustle expecting chaos, bugs, and questionable physics — and to be fair, I got all three. But I also got a surprisingly chill management loop that kept me playing longer than I expected.\n\nThe Good:\nThe shop loop is simple but satisfying\nThe outdoors area actually becomes busy later on\nStaff make life easier once you start using them properly\nProgression speeds up after the tutorial and feels more rewarding\n\nMore importantly:  \nThe dev team are genuinely passionate about their game. They’re active, listening to feedback, and already working on balancing and improvements. Yo…",
